msgstr "Color Transform Mode"

msgid "Inspector:GradientCurve"
msgstr "Mode 1"

msgid "Inspector:GradientHelp"
msgstr "Gradient mode\nMaps the original texture's brightness onto the configured gradient.\nThe leftmost color becomes the darkest pixel, the rightmost becomes the brightest.\nUseful when you want more contrast between shadows and highlights."

