msgstr "Color Matching Ignore (Mask)"

msgid "Inspector:ColorMaskHelp"
msgstr "Use a mask to skip color matching in specific areas.\nThe mask uses the original hair's UVs.\nBlack areas keep their original color and are not recolored."

