msgid "Inspector:UnifyMatCap"
msgstr "Unify MatCap"

msgid "Inspector:UnifyMatCapTooltip"
msgstr "When enabled, MatCap (1st/2nd) is unified to the preview material.\nWhen disabled, each Renderer keeps its original material's MatCap settings."

msgid "Inspector:PreviewHelpMerge"
msgstr "Preview is active. You can check the result in the Scene view.\nStop the preview if it runs slowly.\nNormal maps and AO maps are not applied in preview. Use GestureManager or similar to check the final look."

msgid "Inspector:PreviewRequiresSetup"
msgstr "To enable preview, please set the target Renderers and the base material."

