msgid "Inspector:ApplyDeformation"
msgstr "Bake mesh deformation"

msgid "Inspector:ApplyDeformationTooltip"
msgstr "Bakes mesh deformation data into a new mesh and assigns it to the Renderer."

msgid "Inspector:ApplyHelp"
msgstr "Exports the color-matched texture as a PNG.\n\"Apply texture to material\": assigns the generated texture to the original material's _MainTex.\n\"Unify material settings\": copies the preview material's numeric settings back to the originals.\n\"Bake mesh deformation\": saves a deformed mesh with deformation baked in and assigns it to the Renderer.\nThe component is disabled automatically after applying."

msgid "Inspector:ApplyButton"
msgstr "Apply Chimera Hair Master to Original Hair"

msgid "Inspector:ApplyRequiresSetup"
msgstr "To apply, please set the target Renderers and the base material."

